/-- **The section of the "Claim" of [Stacks Project, Tag 0DT9] on the tensor product presentation
of a base change.** Let `C₁` be a flat strictly henselian local extension of the invariant ring `C`
of `G` and let `x` be a point of `Spec (C' ⊗[C] C₁)` above the closed point of `Spec C₁`. Then the
base-changed map on object schemes `U'₁ ⟶ U₁` admits a section which is an open immersion with
